title:: Executing and Loading .scd Files and SystemAction Hooks (SC-IDE & CLI)
summary:: Guide to startup scripts, event hooks, evaluating, loading, and executing .scd files in SC-IDE and from the command line.
categories:: Tutorials
related:: Classes/Document, Classes/Main#thisProcess, Classes/PathName, Classes/Platform, Classes/File, Classes/Interpreter

DESCRIPTION::
This guide summarizes options for starting SuperCollider, evaluating and loading code, installing event hooks, and executing teletype::.scd:: files in link::Guides/SCIde##SuperCollider-IDE (SC-IDE):: and from the command line.
It also covers techniques for modularizing code with relative paths and automatic execution when a file is opened or when SuperCollider starts.

